OL,3,GNEWSAPolice officer to face tribunal
OL,4,Aover alleged bullying
OL,5,
OL,6,FA West Mercia Police officer is to face
OL,7,Fa misconduct hearing after being
OL,8,Faccused of being a bully.
OL,10,FThe unnamed officer is alleged to have
OL,11,Fbehaved in an "abusive, hostile,
OL,12,Foppressive, derogatory, intimidating
OL,13,Fand/or bullying manner" towards their
OL,14,Fcolleague between March and April 2024.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,356,350,200,160,0,100
