OL,3,GNEWSAPolice officer to face tribunal
OL,4,Aover alleged bullying
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt is also alleged the officer sought
OL,7,Fto influence their inspector's decision
OL,8,Fto move them to a different team, after
OL,9,Fthey had started a romantic
OL,10,Frelationship with someone in the team,
OL,11,Fby making a number of statements which
OL,12,Fwere untrue relating to their service
OL,13,Fin the military.
OL,15,FA gross misconduct hearing will take
OL,16,Fplace next week at West Mercia Police's
OL,17,Fheadquarters in Hindlip,
OL,18,FWorcestershire.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
